BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:practice-2026-09-15@weird.baby
DTSTAMP:20260917T003135Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260917T003135Z
SEQUENCE:29826751
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260915
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260916
SUMMARY:Element takes 1: the Everyday
DESCRIPTION:YOU · LATE\n\n1. The Everyday\, plate on. Gloves\, white coa
 t. iPhone on the tripod\, 4K\, landscape\, 30 fps. No microphone: the s
 ound is laid in afterwards from the machine's own recordings\; the phon
 e's mic is enough as a reference.\n2. Take 1: sixty seconds scrolling t
 he knob and clicking the igniter\, the glass in frame.\n3. Take 2: sixt
 y seconds turning the unit from the top to the back to the front.\n4. T
 ake 3: sixty seconds handheld\, you moving around the device.\n5. Take 
 4: the glass plate. Static\, close\, square on\, sharp\, the display li
 t\, ten seconds. This is what the twin's answer gets composited into.\n
 6. Slate each take: an index card held in front of the lens for two sec
 onds at the start\, written on it EVERYDAY · 09-15 · take N · the room.
  So every file says what it is in its own first frame.\n7. Drop them in
  OneDrive › WeirdBaby › reels › intake › practice as practice-2026-09-1
 5-1.mp4 to -4.mp4\, plus one line of notes: room\, light\, time\, dista
 nce\, the annoyance.\n8. Back to you by Friday: a cut from the takes an
 d the first composite on the glass plate.\n9. 09-16: not landed. What a
 rrived instead is the Gambler tray set and a 4K turn of the Everyday on
  white (docs/desk/GAMBLER-SET.html). The row stays open until the four 
 takes exist.\n\nThe Days: https://claude.ai/code/artifact/207ed53f-1abf
 -4667-82e5-92e3259f4233
CATEGORIES:Weird.Baby You
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
