SUMMARY:Practice reel 4 of 9
DESCRIPTION:YOU\n\n1. Shoot ONE clip\, vertical\, raw\, under 30 seconds
 : any question\, the machine answering. You silent. The Audigo on\, so 
 the machine's own sounds carry. Phone on the tripod in the room you mea
 n to use.\n2. The beat: shake or click\, the answer on the glass\, hold
  two seconds. Nothing else. The question is burned in as text by the re
 el line (ruled 09-12)\; do not show it on camera.\n3. Drop it in OneDri
 ve › WeirdBaby › reels › intake › practice as practice-2026-09-22.mp4 (
 mov is fine).\n4. With it\, one line of notes in chat or a text file be
 side it: room\, light\, time of day\, distance from the lens\, and the 
 thing that annoyed you most.\n5. Success = the file lands\, the glass r
 eads at phone size\, the machine is heard\, the beat is there\, the not
 es line exists\, and it comes back to you the same day built with the p
 op and a three-line read.\n6. Practice 4 of 9. Not posted\, not final\,
  not a real question.\n\nThe Days: https://claude.ai/code/artifact/207e
 d53f-1abf-4667-82e5-92e3259f4233
CATEGORIES:Weird.Baby You
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
